    question: 'How much to spend?',
    answer: 'Daily use at eight plus hours? Four hundred to eight hundred for quality construction. Premium chairs over a grand offer twelve plus years warranty coverage. Budget options work for occasional use but need replacement sooner. A fourteen hundred dollar Herman Miller lasting fifteen years costs less than a hundred per year.',
  },
